new-life-rules = [bold]One new character per round.[/bold]
    Confirming returns you to the lobby. Select a different character with a new name.

    { "[bold]" }Your previous life is over.[/bold]
    You cannot return to your old body. Your new character remembers neither their previous life nor anything learned while observing. Do not use this knowledge, seek revenge, continue old objectives or recover your previous equipment.

    Deliberately ending your life to change characters is prohibited.
    Your use is consumed after successfully spawning your new character.
